# Social app authentication

## Routes (mirror storefront public `/auth`, not account/super-admin)

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `/auth` | Phone check → `/auth/login` or `/auth/register` |
| `/auth/login` | Password login |
| `/auth/login/otp` | OTP login |
| `/auth/register` | OTP for new users |
| `/auth/register/info` | Profile + password completion |
| `/auth/forgot-password` | Request reset OTP |
| `/auth/forgot-password/verify` | OTP + new password |

Canonical entry: **`/auth`**.

## Environment

- **`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL`** — same Strapi API as storefront; must match backend deployment ([`packages/api` config](packages/api/src/config/public.ts)).
- Optional: `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRAPI_TOKEN` for public reads (stories, etc.).

## Tokens

- **Access token:** `localStorage` key from `@repo/api/token` (default `accessToken`). Set via `setAccessToken()` after login/register/OTP.
- **OTP flow:** `sessionStorage` `otpToken` (set by `AuthService.sendOTP`).
- **`ApiClient`** in [`apps/social/src/lib/api-client.ts`](apps/social/src/lib/api-client.ts) attaches Bearer from storage on requests when not skipped.

## Redirect query

- **`?redirect=/some-path`** — preserved across auth steps where applicable; after successful session, navigate to that path if it is a same-origin path (starts with `/`). Social does **not** send users to storefront `/account` or `/super-admin`; default post-login is **`/`**.

## State

- **Jotai** shared store: [`apps/social/src/lib/jotaiStore.ts`](apps/social/src/lib/jotaiStore.ts), wrapped by `Provider` in [`apps/social/src/app/providers.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/providers.tsx).
- Atoms: [`apps/social/src/lib/atoms/auth.ts`](apps/social/src/lib/atoms/auth.ts) (`currentUserAtom`, `userLoadingAtom`, `userErrorAtom`, `redirectUrlAtom`).
- Phone gate: `phoneNumberAtom` in [`useCheckPhoneNumber`](apps/social/src/hooks/useCheckPhoneNumber.ts).

## API surface

- Endpoints: [`apps/social/src/lib/api-endpoints.ts`](apps/social/src/lib/api-endpoints.ts) — `AUTH.*`, `USER.ME`, `STORIES.*`.
- Services: [`AuthService`](apps/social/src/services/auth/index.ts), [`UserService.me`](apps/social/src/services/user/me.ts).

## UI / theming (social, not storefront pink)

- Canvas: **`bg-background`** (`#F9FAFF`). Brand actions/focus: **`infinity-primary`** (`#3D4C6E`) — utilities `bg-infinity-primary`, `text-infinity-primary`, `ring-infinity-primary`, etc.
- Do **not** reintroduce storefront **`pink-*`** / **`rose-*`** for auth chrome; shared patterns live in [`globals.css`](apps/social/src/app/globals.css) (`.card`, `.btn`, `.btn-primary`).
- Auth layout: [`apps/social/src/app/auth/layout.tsx`](apps/social/src/app/auth/layout.tsx). Mobile bottom nav is hidden on `/auth/**` via [`AppChrome`](apps/social/src/components/AppChrome.tsx).

## Differences vs storefront

- No **cart** migration after login.
- No redirects to **`/account`** or **`/super-admin`**.
- Errors: **Persian** user messages via [`getUserFacingErrorMessage`](apps/social/src/utils/userErrorMessage.ts) / [`errorTranslations`](apps/social/src/lib/errorTranslations.ts).

